    {
      "id": "intro_4",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "What, according to the author, is the best way to overcome the fear of death as you get older?",
      "translation": "根据作者的说法，随着年龄的增长，克服对死亡的恐惧的最佳方法是什么？",
      "startTime": 10.6,
      "endTime": 20.21,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "What",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "什么"
          },
          {
            "word": "Is",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "是"
          },
          {
            "word": "You",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "你，你们"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_5",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "Some old people are oppressed by the fear of death.",
      "translation": "有些老年人因对死亡的恐惧而郁郁寡欢。",
      "startTime": 20.22,
      "endTime": 25.13,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Old",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "老的，旧的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "In the young there is a justification for this feeling.",
      "translation": "在年轻人身上，这种感觉是有道理的。",
      "startTime": 25.14,
      "endTime": 28.82,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Young",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "年轻的"
          },
          {
            "word": "Is",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "是"
          },
          {
            "word": "This",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "这，这个"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "Young men who have reason to fear that they will be killed in battle",
      "translation": "有理由害怕在战斗中被杀的年轻人",
      "startTime": 28.83,
      "endTime": 33.23,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Young",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "年轻的"
          },
          {
            "word": "That",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "那个"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "may justifiably feel bitter in the thought",
      "translation": "可能在思想上有理由感到痛苦",
      "startTime": 33.24,
      "endTime": 36.78,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "that they have been cheated of the best things that life has to offer.",
      "translation": "他们被欺骗了生活所能提供的最好的东西。",
      "startTime": 36.79,
      "endTime": 42.44,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "That",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "那个"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "But in an old man who has known human joys and sorrows,",
      "translation": "但在一个知道人类快乐和悲伤的老人身上，",
      "startTime": 42.45,
      "endTime": 48.11,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Old",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "老的，旧的"
          },
          {
            "word": "Man",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "男人"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "and has achieved whatever work it was in him to do,",
      "translation": "并完成了他所做的任何工作，",
      "startTime": 48.12,
      "endTime": 52,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "It",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "它"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "the fear of death is somewhat abject and ignoble.",
      "translation": "怕死就未免有些可鄙，有些不光彩了。",
      "startTime": 52.01,
      "endTime": 56.92,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Is",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "是"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "The best way to overcome it--so at least it seems to me--",
      "translation": "克服它的最好方法--至少在我看来--",
      "startTime": 56.93,
      "endTime": 62.66,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "At",
            "pos": "prep.",
            "meaning": "在...（小地点/时刻）"
