          {
            "word": "It",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "它"
          },
          {
            "word": "Me",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "我（宾格）"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s9",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "is to make your interests gradually wider and more impersonal,",
      "translation": "就是让你的兴趣逐渐变得更加广阔，更加客观，",
      "startTime": 62.67,
      "endTime": 68.04,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Is",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "是"
          },
          {
            "word": "Your",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "你的，你们的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "until bit by bit the walls of the ego recede,",
      "translation": "直到自我的墙壁逐渐消退，",
      "startTime": 68.05,
      "endTime": 73.21
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "and your life becomes increasingly merged in the universal life.",
      "translation": "你的生活越来越多地融入宇宙生活。",
      "startTime": 73.22,
      "endTime": 77.72,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Your",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "你的，你们的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "An individual human existence should be like a river--",
      "translation": "一个人的存在应该像一条河--",
      "startTime": 77.73,
      "endTime": 83.5,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "small at first, narrowly contained within its banks,",
      "translation": "起初很小，狭隘地包含在其银行中，",
      "startTime": 83.51,
      "endTime": 88.41,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "At",
            "pos": "prep.",
            "meaning": "在...（小地点/时刻）"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "and rushing passionately past boulders and over waterfalls.",
      "translation": "热情地冲过巨石和瀑布。",
      "startTime": 88.42,
      "endTime": 93.69
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "Gradually the river grows wider, the banks recede, the waters flow more quietly,",
      "translation": "河水渐渐变宽，堤岸退去，水流更平静，",
      "startTime": 93.7,
      "endTime": 101.17
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "and in the end, without any visiblebreak, they become merged in the sea,",
      "translation": "最终，在没有任何可见的破裂的情况下，它们在海中融合在一起，",
      "startTime": 101.18,
      "endTime": 107.43
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "and painlessly lose their individual being.",
      "translation": "并无痛地失去他们的个人存在。",
      "startTime": 107.44,
      "endTime": 111.18,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "The man who, in old age can see his life in this way,",
      "translation": "那个在晚年能够以这种方式看待自己生活的人，",
      "startTime": 111.19,
      "endTime": 116.76,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Man",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "男人"
          },
          {
            "word": "Old",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "老的，旧的"
          },
          {
            "word": "This",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "这，这个"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "will not suffer from the fear of death,",
      "translation": "不会遭受死亡的恐惧，",
      "startTime": 116.77,
      "endTime": 119.53,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Not",
            "pos": "adv.",
            "meaning": "不，不是"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s20",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "since the things he cares for will continue.",
      "translation": "因为他关心的事情会继续下去。",
      "startTime": 119.54,
      "endTime": 123.37,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s21",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "And if, with the decay of vitality, weariness increases,",
      "translation": "如果随着活力的衰退，疲倦感增加，",
      "startTime": 123.38,
      "endTime": 130.51
    },
    {
      "id": "s22",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "the thought of rest will be not unwelcome.",
      "translation": "休息的想法并非不受欢迎。",
      "startTime": 130.52,
      "endTime": 134.28,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Not",
            "pos": "adv.",
            "meaning": "不，不是"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s23",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "I should wish to die while still at work,",
      "translation": "我想在工作的时候死去，",
      "startTime": 134.29,
      "endTime": 137.81,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "At",
            "pos": "prep.",
            "meaning": "在...（小地点/时刻）"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s24",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "knowing that others will carry on what I can no longer do,",
      "translation": "知道别人会继续做我不能再做的事情，",
      "startTime": 137.82,
      "endTime": 142.35,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
